    "x1": 12410,
    "z1": 17850
   },
   "text": "The gate's been torn off its hinges. From the inside."
  },
  {
   "zone": {
    "x0": 5100,
    "z0": 14450,
    "x1": 10200,
    "z1": 17850
   },
   "text": "Their handler. What's left of him.\nHis catch-pole is snapped in two."
  },
  {
   "zone": {
    "x0": 9010,
    "z0": 6290,
    "x1": 11050,
    "z1": 9690
   },
   "text": "A chain, snapped at the collar end.\nWhatever was on it pulled until it broke."
  },
  {
   "zone": {
    "x0": 11050,
    "z0": 5950,
    "x1": 12070,
    "z1": 22270
   },
   "text": "REX. BRUTUS. SHADOW. KAISER.\nThe dogs on the mountain came from here."
  },
  {
   "zone": {
    "x0": 20740,
    "z0": 8330,
    "x1": 22100,
    "z1": 10880
   },
   "text": "The door won't stay shut.\nThere's a lamp lit on the desk. A feed chart on the wall."
  },
  {
   "zone": {
    "x0": 19210,
    "z0": 18020,
    "x1": 22270,
    "z1": 19380
   },
   "text": "A water trough. The water's pink."
  },
  {
   "zone": {
    "x0": 12750,
    "z0": 9350,
    "x1": 16150,
    "z1": 14450
   },
   "text": "Paw prints, big ones. Heading out to the gate.\nAnd toward the house."
  }
 ],
